    <pous>
      <pou name="PRG_AU_Acquisition" pouType="program">
        <interface>
          <outputVars>
            <variable name="EmergencyChainClosed">
              <type>
                <BOOL />
              </type>
              <documentation>
                <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Boucle AU fermee (qualifie FB_Input, 20 ms)</xhtml>
              </documentation>
            </variable>
            <variable name="PowerContactorEngaged">
              <type>
                <BOOL />
              </type>
              <documentation>
                <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Contacteur puissance engage (qualifie FB_Input, 20 ms)</xhtml>
              </documentation>
            </variable>
            <variable name="PowerCutOffRequest">
              <type>
                <BOOL />
              </type>
              <documentation>
                <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Demande coupure safety metier (agrege)</xhtml>
              </documentation>
            </variable>
          </outputVars>
          <localVars>
            <variable name="instSimChainFeedback">
              <type>
                <derived name="FB_Sim_AU_ChainFeedback" />
              </type>
              <documentation>
                <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Simulation physique boucle AU (banc de test)</xhtml>
              </documentation>
            </variable>
            <variable name="instEmergencyChainClosed">
              <type>
                <derived name="FB_Input" />
              </type>
              <documentation>
                <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Qualification boucle AU (anti-rebond 20 ms)</xhtml>
              </documentation>
            </variable>
            <variable name="instPowerContactorEngaged">
              <type>
                <derived name="FB_Input" />
              </type>
              <documentation>
                <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Qualification retour contacteur (anti-rebond 20 ms)</xhtml>
              </documentation>
            </variable>
          </localVars>
          <documentation>
            <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Acquisition et qualification des entrees AU (CFC natif, cible AF02 §2).
Lit les signaux simules (GVL_Simulation_AU) et les qualifie via FB_Input
(brique standard, meme composant que PRG_00_Inputs) avant transmission
au composite FB_Safety_EmergencyManagement.
Aucune logique metier ici (regle TC-P02-002) : le feedback simulation est
delegue a FB_Sim_AU_ChainFeedback, une page CFC ne fait qu'enchainer des blocs.
Regle de cablage CFC (obligatoire, DOC/CODE_QUALITY_STANDARDS.md paragraphe CFC) : CHAQUE
entree source (inVariable/sortie de bloc) passe par un connector dedie avant
de rejoindre un bloc consommateur -- jamais de connexion directe source vers bloc.
Chaque connector a une position UNIQUE et non nulle (x,y != 0,0 sauf le tout
premier), pour eviter les fils de longueur nulle empiles qui rendent le
cablage illisible/invisible dans l'editeur CODESYS (REX 2026-08).
Docs : DOC/AF_Partie-01_Analyse_Fonctionnelle_v2.0.md
       DOC/AF_Partie-02_Architecture_Programme_v3.0.md §2
       DOC/AF_Partie-06_Acquisition_Qualification_IO_v2.0.md</xhtml>
          </documentation>
        </interface>
        <body>
          <ST>
            <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" />
          </ST>
          <addData>
            <data name="http://www.3s-software.com/plcopenxml/cfc" handleUnknown="implementation">
              <CFC>

                <!-- ═══ Colonne 1 : sources (entrees GVL_Simulation_AU + feedback scan precedent) ═══ -->
                <inVariable localId="1">
                  <position x="10" y="20" />
                  <connectionPointOut>
                    <expression />
                  </connectionPointOut>
                  <expression>GVL_Simulation_AU.SimulationModeActive</expression>
                </inVariable>
                <inVariable localId="2">
                  <position x="10" y="40" />
                  <connectionPointOut>
                    <expression />
                  </connectionPointOut>
                  <expression>GVL_Simulation_AU.SimChainClosed</expression>
                </inVariable>
                <inVariable localId="3">
                  <position x="10" y="60" />
                  <connectionPointOut>
                    <expression />
                  </connectionPointOut>
                  <expression>PRG_AU_Outputs_LD.PowerKeepAlive_A_RQ</expression>
                </inVariable>
                <inVariable localId="4">
                  <position x="10" y="80" />
                  <connectionPointOut>
                    <expression />
                  </connectionPointOut>
                  <expression>PRG_AU_Outputs_LD.PowerKeepAlive_B_RQ</expression>
                </inVariable>

                <!-- Connecteurs dedies (1 par source), positions uniques -->
                <connector localId="5" name="">
                  <position x="40" y="20" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="1" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>
                <connector localId="6" name="">
                  <position x="40" y="40" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="2" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>
                <connector localId="7" name="">
                  <position x="40" y="60" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="3" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>
                <connector localId="8" name="">
                  <position x="40" y="80" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="4" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>

                <!-- ═══ Colonne 2 : Bloc 1 - Simulation physique boucle AU (FB_Sim_AU_ChainFeedback) ═══ -->
                <block localId="10" executionOrderId="1" typeName="FB_Sim_AU_ChainFeedback" instanceName="instSimChainFeedback">
                  <position x="70" y="15" />
                  <inputVariables>
                    <variable formalParameter="SimulationModeActive">
                      <connectionPointIn>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <connection refLocalId="5" />
                      </connectionPointIn>
                    </variable>
                    <variable formalParameter="SimChainClosed">
                      <connectionPointIn>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <connection refLocalId="6" />
                      </connectionPointIn>
                    </variable>
                    <variable formalParameter="MaintainA">
                      <connectionPointIn>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <connection refLocalId="7" />
                      </connectionPointIn>
                    </variable>
                    <variable formalParameter="MaintainB">
                      <connectionPointIn>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <connection refLocalId="8" />
                      </connectionPointIn>
                    </variable>
                  </inputVariables>
                  <inOutVariables />
                  <outputVariables>
                    <variable formalParameter="ChainClosedRaw">
                      <connectionPointOut>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <expression />
                      </connectionPointOut>
                    </variable>
                  </outputVariables>
                  <addData>
                    <data name="http://www.3s-software.com/plcopenxml/cfccalltype" handleUnknown="implementation">
                      <CallType xmlns="">functionblock</CallType>
                    </data>
                  </addData>
                </block>

                <!-- ═══ Colonne 3 : Bloc 2 - Qualification boucle AU (FB_Input) ═══ -->
                <connector localId="11" name="">
                  <position x="105" y="20" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="10" formalParameter="ChainClosedRaw" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>

                <inVariable localId="12">
                  <position x="105" y="35" />
                  <connectionPointOut>
                    <expression />
                  </connectionPointOut>
                  <expression>T#20ms</expression>
                </inVariable>
                <connector localId="13" name="">
                  <position x="120" y="35" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="12" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>

                <block localId="20" executionOrderId="2" typeName="FB_Input" instanceName="instEmergencyChainClosed">
                  <position x="140" y="15" />
                  <inputVariables>
                    <variable formalParameter="InputRaw">
                      <connectionPointIn>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <connection refLocalId="11" />
                      </connectionPointIn>
                    </variable>
                    <variable formalParameter="FilterTime">
                      <connectionPointIn>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <connection refLocalId="13" />
                      </connectionPointIn>
                    </variable>
                  </inputVariables>
                  <inOutVariables />
                  <outputVariables>
                    <variable formalParameter="State">
                      <connectionPointOut>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <expression />
                      </connectionPointOut>
                    </variable>
                  </outputVariables>
                  <addData>
                    <data name="http://www.3s-software.com/plcopenxml/cfccalltype" handleUnknown="implementation">
                      <CallType xmlns="">functionblock</CallType>
                    </data>
                  </addData>
                </block>

                <!-- ═══ Colonne 4 : sortie EmergencyChainClosed ═══ -->
                <connector localId="21" name="">
                  <position x="175" y="20" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="20" formalParameter="State" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>
                <outVariable localId="22">
                  <position x="195" y="20" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="21" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                  <expression>EmergencyChainClosed</expression>
                </outVariable>

                <!-- ═══ Ligne 2 : Bloc 3 - Qualification retour contacteur (FB_Input) ═══ -->
                <inVariable localId="30">
                  <position x="10" y="120" />
                  <connectionPointOut>
                    <expression />
                  </connectionPointOut>
                  <expression>GVL_Simulation_AU.SimContactorEngaged</expression>
                </inVariable>
                <connector localId="32" name="">
                  <position x="40" y="120" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="30" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>

                <inVariable localId="31">
                  <position x="10" y="140" />
                  <connectionPointOut>
                    <expression />
                  </connectionPointOut>
                  <expression>T#20ms</expression>
                </inVariable>
                <connector localId="33" name="">
                  <position x="40" y="140" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="31" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>

                <block localId="40" executionOrderId="3" typeName="FB_Input" instanceName="instPowerContactorEngaged">
                  <position x="70" y="115" />
                  <inputVariables>
                    <variable formalParameter="InputRaw">
                      <connectionPointIn>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <connection refLocalId="32" />
                      </connectionPointIn>
                    </variable>
                    <variable formalParameter="FilterTime">
                      <connectionPointIn>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <connection refLocalId="33" />
                      </connectionPointIn>
                    </variable>
                  </inputVariables>
                  <inOutVariables />
                  <outputVariables>
                    <variable formalParameter="State">
                      <connectionPointOut>
                        <relPosition x="0" y="0" />
                        <expression />
                      </connectionPointOut>
                    </variable>
                  </outputVariables>
                  <addData>
                    <data name="http://www.3s-software.com/plcopenxml/cfccalltype" handleUnknown="implementation">
                      <CallType xmlns="">functionblock</CallType>
                    </data>
                  </addData>
                </block>

                <connector localId="41" name="">
                  <position x="105" y="120" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="40" formalParameter="State" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>
                <outVariable localId="42">
                  <position x="140" y="120" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="41" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                  <expression>PowerContactorEngaged</expression>
                </outVariable>

                <!-- ═══ Ligne 3 : agregation coupure metier (passthrough direct, pas de FB) ═══ -->
                <inVariable localId="50">
                  <position x="10" y="180" />
                  <connectionPointOut>
                    <expression />
                  </connectionPointOut>
                  <expression>GVL_Simulation_AU.SimPowerCutOffReq</expression>
                </inVariable>
                <connector localId="52" name="">
                  <position x="40" y="180" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="50" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                </connector>
                <outVariable localId="51">
                  <position x="70" y="180" />
                  <connectionPointIn>
                    <connection refLocalId="52" />
                  </connectionPointIn>
                  <expression>PowerCutOffRequest</expression>
                </outVariable>

              </CFC>
            </data>
          </addData>
        </body>
        <addData>
          <data name="http://www.3s-software.com/plcopenxml/objectid" handleUnknown="discard">
            <ObjectId>c3f8a1e6-9a2d-4b7e-8f3a-1e6d9c2b5a70</ObjectId>
          </data>
        </addData>
      </pou>
    </pous>
  </types>
